    "classification_basis": "source_brief_and_visual",
    "classification_notes": "The brief names Material Interval, but the output visibly presents a photographic-style coffee hero. Classified by the rendered appearance while retaining the documented method tag. The surviving brief is supporting evidence, not an exact generation prompt.",
    "sha256": "932d2f3bdce762ff7b056cfe91b781b1eb7b44e9de19def3a5c9a54b13e20181",
